skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #0B4ED8
footer Dipelihara di docs/diagram-uml, render dari sumber .puml
title Kelas domain At Cell
class Produk {
  +id: int
  +brand: string
  +model_name: string
  +specs: string
  +default_price: number
  +image_url: string
}
class Unit {
  +id: int
  +product_id: int?
  +imei: string
  +condition: new | second
  +purchase_cost: number
  +selling_price: number
  +status: UnitStatus
}
class Transaksi {
  +id: int
  +customer_name: string
  +customer_phone: string
  +sales_id: string
  +total_amount: number
  +trade_in_deduction: number
  +final_payment: number
  +payment_method: PaymentMethod
}
class Rincian {
  +id: int
  +unit_price: number
  +warranty_duration_months: number
}
class TukarTambah {
  +id: int
  +original_brand_model: string
  +imei: string
  +grading_details: json
  +photo_urls: string[]
  +offered_price: number
}
class Tiket {
  +id: int
  +ticket_code: string
  +customer_name: string
  +device_model: string
  +imei_or_sn: string
  +issue_notes: string
  +repair_status: RepairStatus
  +sparepart_fee: number
  +labor_fee: number
  +total_fee: number
  +photo_urls: string[]
}
class Biaya {
  +id: string
  +name: string
  +cost: number
  +type: sparepart | labor
}
class Profil {
  +id: string
  +full_name: string
  +role: UserRole
  +phone_number: string
}
class PengaturanToko {
  +store_name: string
  +address: string
  +phone_number: string
  +opening_hours: json
}
class LayananToko <<store>> {
  +jualUnit()
  +buatTiket()
  +updateTiket()
  +daftarBatchUnit()
  +ubahStatusUnit()
  +simpanPengaturan()
  +undangStaf()
}
Produk "1" -- "0..*" Unit : punya
Transaksi "1" *-- "1..*" Rincian : dirinci
Rincian "*" -- "1" Unit : menjual
Transaksi "1" -- "0..1" TukarTambah : dipotong
TukarTambah --> Unit : unit lama masuk stok
Tiket "1" *-- "*" Biaya : dirinci
Profil "1" -- "*" Transaksi : mencatat
Profil "1" -- "*" Tiket : menangani
LayananToko ..> Transaksi : tulis
LayananToko ..> Tiket : tulis
LayananToko ..> Unit : tulis
note bottom of LayananToko
  Kode implementasi sebagai fungsi store
  dan Server Actions, bukan class OOP.
  Nama operasi mengikuti perilakunya.
end note
@enduml
